        {
          "id": 506544018,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Ok let us get to the bottom line. In the current merge request, I do the following:\n\n* address is printed in HEX\n* key is printed in HEX\n* size is printed in HEX_DEC\n\nCan you approve that, please?",
